---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
permalink: /about/
description: John Carl Dimatulac is a full-stack web developer and automation engineer in Sta. Rosa, Laguna. He builds operational systems for teams whose work has outgrown spreadsheets and manual follow-ups.
---

<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="hero__grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
    <span class="label label--signal">About</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:1rem;max-width:18ch">I build systems because I have seen what broken operations cost.</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead">
        <figure class="portrait" data-reveal>
          <img src="{{ site.portrait }}" alt="{{ site.owner }}" width="1200" height="1200" loading="eager" decoding="async">
          <figcaption class="label label--plain label--faint">{{ site.owner }} — {{ site.location }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <div class="split__body">
        <p class="lede">
          {{ site.owner }} is a full-stack web developer and automation engineer
          based in Sta. Rosa, Laguna, Philippines. He builds operational systems
          for teams whose day-to-day work has outgrown spreadsheets,
          disconnected tools, and manual follow-ups.
        </p>

        <div class="facts-list">
          <div class="facts-list__item" data-reveal>
            <span class="facts-list__k">8+ years</span>
            <span class="facts-list__v">Building web applications, WordPress plugins and themes, and automation pipelines.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="facts-list__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="60">
            <span class="facts-list__k">Inside the operation</span>
            <span class="facts-list__v">IT staff at a construction yard, network administrator for an office, and now the freelance developer behind a security company's site and internal tools. Not only an outside developer.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="facts-list__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="120">
            <span class="facts-list__k">Problems solved</span>
            <span class="facts-list__v">Scheduling, tracking, workflow automation, internal tools, and reporting, for clients in security services, logistics, education, and government.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="facts-list__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="180">
            <span class="facts-list__k">How I work</span>
            <span class="facts-list__v">Direct and practical. The measure of a system is whether the team is still using it a month later, so that is what everything is built around.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="facts-list__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="240">
            <span class="facts-list__k">Stack</span>
            <span class="facts-list__v">React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, PHP and WordPress; PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB and Firebase; n8n and AI content pipelines; Vercel, Railway, Cloudflare and GitHub Actions.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center">
          <a class="btn" href="/start/">Start a project <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          {% if site.resumeUrl %}
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.resumeUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Résumé (PDF) <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          {% for s in site.social %}{% if s.label == 'LinkedIn' and s.href %}
            <a class="link" href="{{ s.href }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section" style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink-14)">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">Where I have worked</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
      <span class="label label--plain label--faint">As on the résumé</span>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">
      {% for job in operations.history %}
        <article class="timeline__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 70 }}">
          <div>
            <span class="label label--signal">{{ job.date }}</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="margin-top:1rem">{{ job.title }}</h2>
            <p class="label label--faint" style="margin-top:.5rem">{{ job.company }}</p>
            <div class="impact">
              <span class="label label--faint">Delivered</span>
              <div class="impact__value">{{ job.delivered }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="timeline__points">
            {% for point in job.points %}<li class="timeline__point"><span>{{ point }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="body body--sm" style="margin-top:2rem">
      Also: <a class="link" href="{{ site.elimate }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Elimate Web Automation</a>,
      a personal venture turning standard websites into automated platforms.
      BS Information Technology, Occidental Mindoro State College. NC II Computer
      Hardware Servicing, NC IV Computer Programming.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--dark section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead"><h2 class="h2">Tell me where the work leaks.</h2></div>
      <div class="split__body">
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
          A written reply within one business day, with a straight answer on
          whether it is a fit and what the first build would be.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem">
          <a class="btn" href="/start/">Start a project <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/process/">How the work runs <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
